  "description": "A lightweight, zero-dependency logger for .NET and Unity: severity levels with fan-out to console, debug, and file sinks (or your own), configurable message formatting, automatic caller context via [CallerMemberName], object/property dumps, and an optional static LoggerService. String logging (not structured) — a simple, code-first companion, not a Serilog replacement.",
